  "body": "## What changed\n\n- `unit_env::plan_notes` builds the UI directory as `root.join(\"crates\").join(\"ui\")`. Before, it used `root.join(\"crates/ui\")`.\n- The test `plan_notes_only_scan_ui_config_for_ui_steps` builds its expected config path by components too.\n- A new source pin, `plan_notes_join_the_ui_directory_by_components`, keeps the production join in that form.\n- A decision file: `docs/decisions/4454-win-ui-config-path.md`.\n\n## Cause\n\nOn Windows, `Path::join(\"crates/ui\")` keeps the `/` in the path. The note showed `...\\crates/ui\\.cargo\\config.toml`. The test expected `...\\crates/ui/.cargo\\config.toml`. The strings did not match, so the test failed on Windows only. Linux uses `/` everywhere, so Linux and macOS passed.\n\n## Tests\n\n- Pin: `unit_env::tests::plan_notes_join_the_ui_directory_by_components`. It fails on unchanged code on Linux: `plan_notes must join crates and ui as two components`.\n- Mutation: I put the old join back. The pin failed. I restored the fix. The pin passed.\n- `plan_notes_only_scan_ui_config_for_ui_steps` passes on Linux before and after. Its Windows failure cannot show on Linux.\n- `cargo test -p xtask --bin xtask unit_env::`: 15 passed.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` on the final head: 1 step (`xtask unit tests`), 0 failed, 339 s.\n- `cargo clippy -p xtask --all-targets -- -D warnings`: one error, in `xtask/src/unit_sweep.rs:67` (`clippy::needless_bool`). This PR does not touch that file. The same error is on upstream/main `1cf7390dc`. The changed lines in this PR give no lint.\n- Heavy lanes: not run. The diff touches only `xtask/`, and no heavy lane covers it.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone. The diff changes no recorded program. It touches only `xtask/` and `docs/decisions/`. I did not run `example_catalog`, because the diff cannot reach it.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- I did not run the test on Windows. No Windows host is available to this worker. The Windows check watcher of main will confirm it after the merge.\n- #4427 and #4428 have the same kind of separator failure in `unit_env/config.rs` tests. This PR does not fix them.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone. No open PR changes `xtask/src/unit_env.rs`.\n\nProcess change: yes\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #4454\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
